# LLM config for the vendored content generator.
#
# This vendored copy reads ONLY `OPENAI_API_KEY` and hardcodes the models
# (OpenAI: gpt-5.5; Ollama fallback: gpt-oss:20b). `LLM_PROVIDER`, `OPENAI_MODEL`,
# `API_BASE`, and `LLM_MODEL` are NOT consumed here — don't expect them to switch
# the model/endpoint. (To change models, edit assets/content-gen/lib/llm.ts.)
#
# Set a key to use OpenAI:
OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
# Leave OPENAI_API_KEY empty to fall back to a local Ollama server (gpt-oss:20b).
